    "evidence": "The Paxos terms jointly identify PDS and PIE as USDG issuers and section 3.5 gives Paxos freeze, seizure and destruction powers applying to all holders. The USDG contract specification states that ASSET_PROTECTION_ROLE can freeze or unfreeze any on-chain balance and wipe a frozen balance. This confirms the existing Yes verdict from primary evidence rather than from centralized classification.",
